<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><title>Staff Invitation · Classic Mart</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/role-dashboard.css"></head><body><main class="role-main"><div class="role-shell"><section class="role-content"><div class="page-heading role-page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Privileged access</span><h1>Classic Mart staff invitation</h1><p>This invitation does not activate a platform role by itself. Your identity must meet the security requirements and a different administrator must approve the grant.</p></div><a class="outline-button" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></div><section class="panel role-focus-panel"><h2><%=invitation.role.replaceAll('_',' ')%></h2><p><strong>Account:</strong> <%=invitation.emailMasked%></p><p><strong>Operational countries:</strong> <%=invitation.operationalCountries.join(', ')%></p><%if(invitation.warehouseScopes?.length){%><p><strong>Warehouse scope:</strong> <%=invitation.warehouseScopes.join(', ')%></p><%}%><p><strong>Approved access lifetime after activation:</strong> <%=invitation.grantDurationDays||180%> day(s)</p><p><strong>Invitation expires:</strong> <%=formatDate(invitation.expiresAt)%></p><div class="catalogue-stack"><article class="catalog-row"><div><strong>Email verification</strong><small><%=invitation.emailVerified?'Complete':'Required'%></small></div></article><article class="catalog-row"><div><strong>Phone verification</strong><small><%=invitation.phoneVerified?'Complete':'Required'%></small></div></article><article class="catalog-row"><div><strong>Multi-factor authentication</strong><small><%=invitation.mfaEnabled?'Complete':'Required before acceptance'%></small></div></article></div><%if(invitation.ready){%><form method="post" action="/staff/invitations/<%=encodeURIComponent(token)%>/accept"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%=csrfToken%>"><button class="primary-button" type="submit">Accept and send for four-eyes approval</button></form><%}else{%><p>Complete the missing account-security requirements first.</p><div><a class="primary-button" href="/account/security">Open account security</a><a class="outline-button" href="/dashboard">Back to dashboard</a></div><%}%></section></section></div></main></body></html>
